Subject: Select original task scheduling and explicit movie service boundary

Upstream-base: 01c9a4d61904afc927d6752c3cd29fca489ff5cc

Retain original intrusive insertion, state notification order, per-task ticker
sampling, bounds/dilation and post-task MoviePlay calls. Native registration is
borrowed: checked creation, duplicate/reentrant/thread rejection, detach on typed
task destruction and final manager teardown prevent stale ring entries. A frame
exception requires teardown before another run. Initialize host-only metadata.
The selected movie unit retains its real inactive queries and control branches;
THP initialization, start and active playback/stop are explicit failure points.
No full frame-task initialization, movie decoder or successful service stub is
introduced. The Wii ticker arithmetic remains unchanged, including wrap behavior.

